This repository contains code derived from the following projects.

LLaVA -- https://github.com/haotian-liu/LLaVA
  Copyright 2023 Haotian Liu et al. Licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
  llava/ is derived from LLaVA-1.5. Training and serving code was removed;
  inference and evaluation code is kept.

LLaVA-PruMerge -- https://github.com/42Shawn/LLaVA-PruMerge
  Copyright Yuzhang Shang, Mu Cai, Bingxin Xu et al. Licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
  This codebase started as a fork of LLaVA-PruMerge. The PruMerge token-reduction
  functions (outlier_dectection, token_prune_merge_advanced*) remain in
  llava/model/multimodal_encoder/clip_encoder.py; latency/measure_edge.py uses
  outlier_dectection to time the PruMerge comparison point.

PruneSID -- https://github.com/ZhengyaoFang/PruneSID
  Fang et al., "Prune Redundancy, Preserve Essence: Vision Token Compression in
  VLMs via Synergistic Importance-Diversity", ICLR 2026. Licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
  _prunesid_batch_pca, _prunesid_similarity_nms and the cluster-quota selection in
  CLIPVisionTower.token_prunesid_quant_select are ported from PruneSID's
  prunesid_llava/clip_encoder.py. They were modified to add a seeded PCA and to
  hand the selected tokens on to the sink-aware tiered quantization.

turboquant-pytorch -- https://github.com/tonbistudio/turboquant-pytorch (commit 9997138)
  Copyright (c) 2026 tonbistudio. Licensed under the MIT License (turboquant/LICENSE).
  turboquant/compressors_v3.py was modified (StratifiedCompressor added);
